2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A569%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E9%AB%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A570%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%86%E5%B1%82%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A571%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VLLM%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A567%2C%22y%22%3A257%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A319%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E7%BB%B4%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A571%2C%22y%22%3A174%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u73195977%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua36735e7\" id=\"ua36735e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucda7696f\" id=\"ucda7696f\">自动化测试框架在LLM开发中的应用是评估模型性能、保障交付质量的核心环节。结合真实项目案例，需从以下维度展开：</span></p><ol list=\"u96c32a98\"><li fid=\"uece6c9ba\" data-lake-id=\"u138d9488\" id=\"u138d9488\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u65efedd4\" id=\"u65efedd4\">痛点分析</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u62637904\" id=\"u62637904\">：明确LLM开发中传统测试的局限性（如人工成本高、覆盖率不足、动态场景难以模拟等）。</span></li><li fid=\"uece6c9ba\" data-lake-id=\"u75900cfb\" id=\"u75900cfb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u762afd11\" id=\"u762afd11\">框架设计</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uee38ff56\" id=\"uee38ff56\">：构建分层测试体系，覆盖功能、性能、安全等多维度。</span></li><li fid=\"uece6c9ba\" data-lake-id=\"u7707e44c\" id=\"u7707e44c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u95afa411\" id=\"u95afa411\">技术实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3b199f3c\" id=\"u3b199f3c\">：利用LangChain、vLLM等工具实现自动化测试流程。</span></li><li fid=\"uece6c9ba\" data-lake-id=\"ufdb4a9aa\" id=\"ufdb4a9aa\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u10a719f5\" id=\"u10a719f5\">效果验证</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u29bc5f2b\" id=\"u29bc5f2b\">：通过案例说明自动化测试如何提升效率并保障模型可靠性。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22S1YMS%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u675490e0\" id=\"u675490e0\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u685036f9\" id=\"u685036f9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752481037756-80023836-1e5d-4e89-b5b3-1ec43d02a934.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u57c0f585-a33f-4779-9b28-70d752f99e5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4ec8e2bb-1550-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A449.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A163%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A30012%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A674%2C%22originHeight%22%3A245%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%22%2C%22x%22%3A536%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E8%BD%AE%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A537%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9%E5%AE%A2%E6%9C%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A538%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A297%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A298%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B9%BB%E8%A7%89%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%22%2C%22x%22%3A535%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%9E%E6%9D%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A536%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%22%2C%22x%22%3A537%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf1b09962%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"b7e4b502\" id=\"b7e4b502\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a02557e\" id=\"u1a02557e\">案例背景：保险行业AI助手开发</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u0ea5b0da\" id=\"u0ea5b0da\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7080f350\" id=\"u7080f350\">场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab2d2c2d\" id=\"uab2d2c2d\">：某保险公司开发基于LLM的智能客服系统，需支持保单查询、理赔指导、条款解释等复杂场景。<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4beb9e99\" id=\"u4beb9e99\">痛点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u307e4411\" id=\"u307e4411\">：</span></p><ul list=\"ua0930c95\"><li fid=\"u8124e386\" data-lake-id=\"uca37cfcd\" id=\"uca37cfcd\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u91672de5\" id=\"u91672de5\">测试数据庞杂</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d8012ac\" id=\"u2d8012ac\">：需覆盖200+业务场景、10万+历史保单数据。</span></li><li fid=\"u8124e386\" data-lake-id=\"u4dde65b5\" id=\"u4dde65b5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc8faf8f1\" id=\"uc8faf8f1\">多轮交互验证困难</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1ab9fe4e\" id=\"u1ab9fe4e\">：用户提问可能涉及跨保单、跨时间的关联信息。</span></li><li fid=\"u8124e386\" data-lake-id=\"uf9aa8844\" id=\"uf9aa8844\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u307e9390\" id=\"u307e9390\">幻觉风险高</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u403b8852\" id=\"u403b8852\">：模型易生成不符合保险条款的误导性回答。</span></li><li fid=\"u8124e386\" data-lake-id=\"u5ce96